		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">39</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints to put the logic in words.

1. As I process 1000 values, it will be difficult for me to remember the total lifespan in my memory. So, I will take a paper and write down the total lifespan. That way, for every value, I will update the paper and I don't need to worry about forgetting.
2. If it is a small list like 3 or 5 values, then it is easy for me to remember how many values I checked. But 1000 is a large number. So, to avoid checking more than 1000, I will also keep a count of how many values I checked until now. Whenever it reaches 1000, I will stop processing. This count also, I will write on a paper (just like total lifespan).</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">382.68849206349205</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">3402.557547206441</attribute>
				<attribute key="w" type="double">290.8219086108528</attribute>
				<attribute key="h" type="double">251.1585200231401</attribute>
				<attribute key="type" type="String">rectangle</attribute>
				<attribute key="raisedBorder" type="boolean">false</attribute>
				<attribute key="fill" type="String">#FFCC00</attribute>
				<attribute key="outline" type="String">#000000</attribute>
			</section>
			<section name="LabelGraphics">
				<attribute key="text" type="String">Following are some hints to put the logic in words.

1. As I process 1000 values, it will be difficult for me to remember the total lifespan in my memory. So, I will take a paper and write down the total lifespan. That way, for every value, I will update the paper and I don't need to worry about forgetting.
2. If it is a small list like 3 or 5 values, then it is easy for me to remember how many values I checked. But 1000 is a large number. So, to avoid checking more than 1000, I will also keep a count of how many values I checked until now. Whenever it reaches 1000, I will stop processing. This count also, I will write on a paper (just like total lifespan).</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontSize" type="int">12</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontName" type="String">Dialog</attribute>
