			</section>
		</section>
		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">40</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following is what I came up with.

1. Read list size
2. Write down 2 things - numberCount and totalLifespan. Initially both of them will be 0.
3. Take a value
4. Check if it is positive
5. If yes, add it to totalLifespan
6. In any case, increase numberCount
7. Repeat steps 3 to 6 until numberCount becomes same as listSize
8. By the end, totalLifespan will have the total lifespan of all functional macbooks</attribute>
